# The frozen evidence kernel is sealed by a SHA-256 of its BYTES, so any
# line-ending rewrite breaks the seal. MEASURED: committing src/evidence for
# the first time converted all 795 lines to CRLF, and the manifest check then
# refused to load v2.0 -- "the frozen evidence kernel does not match its
# reviewed manifest" -- although not one character of the code had changed.
#
# These two files are byte-stable in the repository and on every checkout.
src/evidence/runtime_v2_0.py      text eol=lf
src/evidence/runtime_versions.json text eol=lf
